 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2016) '- A misconfigured cache degrades silently (local disk, or errored
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-2016) '  requests) without failing the build, so "the build worked" is not
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2016) '  evidence the cache worked.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2016) '- The check should be one command, not a ritual or a log dive.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2016) '- Credentials are scoped to the `do-tor1` AWS profile, not global
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2016) '  environment variables, so the check must not require exporting
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-2016) '  secrets.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

