 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:23Z (RFD66606-2016) 'install that forgets the `SCCACHE_*` environment is an installation
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:24Z (RFD66606-2016) 'defect rather than an open question.
 # tags: rfd:details
