 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:27Z (RFD66606-2016) '  `SCCACHE_ENDPOINT`, `SCCACHE_REGION`, `SCCACHE_S3_USE_SSL`,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:28Z (RFD66606-2016) '  `SCCACHE_S3_KEY_PREFIX`) are set globally; credentials live in the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2016  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:29Z (RFD66606-2016) '  `do-tor1` profile (`~/.aws/credentials`) and are applied only for the
 # tags: rfd:details
